      "content": "it feels like you're saying highway expansion is basically just a band-aid that doesn't work. if i'm presenting this to a board that's really worried about the economic impact on suburban workers and freight delivery, how should i frame the debate so it doesn't look like i'm just dismissing the road side of things as \"outdated\"?",
